grounding.quote:
Inside-out hard-break migration applies when the project remains on the
same implementation line and the authoritative source truth is being
replaced in place;

make the requirement
surface the sole live requirement authority before proceeding to design and
code;

nothing carries forward by default, and every
retained statement, requirement, design choice or guide rule must be
explicitly re-adopted;

includes an authority trace, realisation proof, negative proof
where drift is plausible, and a present-tense statement of the residual
open pressure;

the system validates and admits or rejects the contract
(ACTIVATION §1, Admission); execution may proceed in the same invocation
under the admitted contract; closure is checked against that same contract;

An existing bounded construction or evidence grant may
permit the cheapest useful discriminator, including obtaining the first
candidate, without asserting that the candidate is conformant;

it is lawful to zero
inherited constitutional surfaces on the migration line and rebuild them
from first principles;

The change classes a ticket records are
[SPEC_METHOD §4](SPEC_METHOD.md#change-classes), which is the triage target
of every clause here that names a class;

